"sdp.overview.projectMgmt.projectFlow.setUpGuideContent" : "<ol><li>Smelltu \u00e1 flipann Stj\u00f3rnun (Admin).</li><li>F\u00e6r\u00f0u inn Verkefnategundir og Verkefnast\u00f6\u00f0u \u00ed hlutanum Verkefnastj\u00f3rnun.</li><li>Smelltu \u00e1 flipann Verkefnastj\u00f3rnun.</li><li>H\u00e6gt er a\u00f0 b\u00e6ta vi\u00f0 og stj\u00f3rna verkefnum \u00ed flipanum Verkefni.</li></ol>",
