"sdp.overview.requestMgmt.defineYourOrganization.content" : "<p>Vera m\u00e1 a\u00f0 fyrirt\u00e6ki\u00f0 \u00feitt s\u00e9 \u00e1 fleiri en einum sta\u00f0 og hafi margar deildir. Vera m\u00e1 a\u00f0 t\u00f6lvut\u00e6kni\u00fej\u00f3nustan s\u00e9 \u00e1 einum og sama sta\u00f0num e\u00f0a a\u00f0 h\u00fan s\u00e9 \u00e1 st\u00f6\u00f0um sem eru \u00e1 mismunandi t\u00edmabeltum. \u00cd sl\u00edkum tilfellum getur\u00f0u sett upp sv\u00e6\u00f0i, vinnusta\u00f0i, deildir, vinnustundir, fr\u00ed o.s.frv. \u00ed ServiceDesk Plus. Me\u00f0 vinnusta\u00f0 er \u00e1tt vi\u00f0 raunverulega sta\u00f0setningu (\u00fatib\u00fa) fyrirt\u00e6kisins.  Hver vinnusta\u00f0ur getur haft s\u00ednar eigin vinnustundir, fr\u00ed og vinnudaga.</p>",
