"sdp.overview.integrations.fullContent" : "\u00de\u00fa getur n\u00e1\u00f0 fullkominni inns\u00fdn og stj\u00f3rn \u00e1 t\u00f6lvut\u00e6kni\u00fej\u00f3nustunni me\u00f0 innbygg\u00f0um sam\u00fe\u00e6ttingum \u00ed bo\u00f0i ServiceDesk Plus \u00e1samt \u00f6\u00f0rum stj\u00f3rnb\u00fana\u00f0i fyrir t\u00f6lvut\u00e6kni\u00fej\u00f3nustu fr\u00e1 ManageEngine. \u00de\u00fa getur stj\u00f3rna\u00f0 netkerfum, forritum og skj\u00e1bor\u00f0um fr\u00e1 stj\u00f3rnbor\u00f0i t\u00f6lvut\u00e6knideildar og fengi\u00f0 a\u00f0gang a\u00f0 \u00edtarlegum greiningum ServiceDesk. ServiceDesk Plus gerir einnig s\u00e9rsni\u00f0nar forskriftarvi\u00f0b\u00e6tur virkar (Python, PowerShell, VBScript), framkv\u00e6mdara\u00f0ger\u00f0ir Java \u00fej\u00f3nsmegin og JavaScript fyrir vi\u00f0skiptavini.",
