"sdp.overview.projectMgmt.milestoneTasks.content" : "<p>Verkefnum m\u00e1 skipta ni\u00f0ur \u00ed mismunandi stig sem k\u00f6llu\u00f0 eru \u00e1fangar. Hverjum \u00e1fanga m\u00e1 skipta \u00ed verk sem \u00fathluta\u00f0 er til t\u00e6knimanna. \u00de\u00fa getur tryggt r\u00e9tta framkv\u00e6md allra verkanna me\u00f0 \u00fev\u00ed a\u00f0 setja upp tengsl \u00e1 milli verka. \u00de\u00fa getur einnig skr\u00e1\u00f0 t\u00edmann sem eytt er \u00ed hvert verk til a\u00f0 f\u00e1 yfirs\u00fdn yfir \u00fea\u00f0 sem lagt er \u00ed verkefni\u00f0 \u00ed samanbur\u00f0i vi\u00f0 \u00fea\u00f0 sem \u00e1\u00e6tla\u00f0 var.</p>",
