"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.chngSettings.content" : "<p>\u00de\u00fa getur tilgreint \u00fdmsa eiginleika breytinga s.s. \u00e1hrif, tegund breytinga, \u00e1h\u00e6ttu, forgangsr\u00f6\u00f0 og mikilv\u00e6gi. \u00deessir \u00fe\u00e6ttir, \u00e1samt uppl\u00fdsingum um breytingar, s.s. \u00e1st\u00e6\u00f0u o.s.frv. geta hj\u00e1lpa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e9r a\u00f0 greina og forgangsra\u00f0a breytingum. Tegund breytingar, \u00e1h\u00e6ttu hennar e\u00f0a uppl\u00fdsingar um \u00e1hrif \u00e1 fyrirt\u00e6ki\u00f0 a\u00f0sto\u00f0a \u00feig vi\u00f0 a\u00f0 \u00e1kvar\u00f0a vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i og sam\u00feykktir breytingarinnar.</p>",
