"integrations.sccm" : "Grei\u00f0ir fyrir ein\u00e1tta sam\u00fe\u00e6ttingu Microsoft System Centre Configuration Manager (SCCM) og forritsins okkar, \u00fear sem sk\u00f6nnunarg\u00f6gn eigna eru s\u00f3tt \u00far SCCM og f\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00ed forriti\u00f0 okkar.",
"sdp.dc.dcmenus.patch.management" : "B\u00f3tastj\u00f3rnun",
"sdp.overview.integrations.customScript.content" : "<p>\u00de\u00fa getur virkt keyrslu s\u00e9rsni\u00f0inna forskrifta \u00e1 bor\u00f0 vi\u00f0 Python, VBScript og Shell Scripts \u00feegar bei\u00f0ni er b\u00fain til e\u00f0a henni breytt. \u00deessar forskriftir m\u00e1 keyra handvirkt e\u00f0a sj\u00e1lfvirkt eftir eiginleikum afgrei\u00f0slumi\u00f0ans, s.s. flokki, forgangi, stigi, m\u00e1ta, deild, bi\u00f0janda o.s.frv. Bei\u00f0ni fr\u00e1 starfsmanni fyrirt\u00e6kisins getur \u00fearfnast vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreita og s\u00e9rsni\u00f0inna a\u00f0ger\u00f0a sem nau\u00f0synlegt g\u00e6ti veri\u00f0 a\u00f0 sty\u00f0ja me\u00f0 forskrift. \u00de\u00fa getur nota\u00f0 s\u00e9rsni\u00f0i\u00f0 JavaScript hj\u00e1 vi\u00f0skiptavini til a\u00f0 stj\u00f3rna vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i notendavi\u00f0m\u00f3ts samkv\u00e6mt \u00fe\u00ednum eigin kr\u00f6fum.</p>",
