"sdp.overview.assetMgmt.sftLicensing.content" : "<p>Rakning og stj\u00f3rnun hugb\u00fana\u00f0arleyfa eitt af \u00fev\u00ed erfi\u00f0asta sem t\u00f6lvut\u00e6knideildir \u00feurfa a\u00f0 sj\u00e1 um. Sl\u00f6k stj\u00f3rnun \u00e1 hugb\u00fana\u00f0arleyfum getur leitt til brota \u00e1 leyfum samkv\u00e6mt st\u00f6\u00f0lum seljanda \u00feeirra. ServiceDesk Plus gerir \u00fe\u00e9r kleift a\u00f0 skanna allar vinnust\u00f6\u00f0varnar \u00fe\u00ednar til a\u00f0 leita a\u00f0 og flytja inn allar uppl\u00fdsingar um uppsettan hugb\u00fana\u00f0 sj\u00e1lfkrafa. \u00de\u00fa getur flokka\u00f0 hugb\u00fana\u00f0 \u00ed mismunandi flokka, s.s. undir stj\u00f3rn, deildur hugb\u00fana\u00f0ur, gjaldfrj\u00e1ls hugb\u00fana\u00f0ur og banna\u00f0ur hugb\u00fana\u00f0ur til a\u00f0 au\u00f0velt s\u00e9 a\u00f0 rekja hann og stj\u00f3rna honum. \u00de\u00fa getur einnig keypt, dreift, raki\u00f0 og stj\u00f3rna\u00f0 hugb\u00fana\u00f0arleyfum til a\u00f0 n\u00e1 fullkominni eftirfylgni hugb\u00fana\u00f0arleyfa.</p>",
