"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.resources.content" : "<p>Fyrir alla \u00fej\u00f3nustu sem \u00fe\u00fa b\u00fd\u00f0ur upp \u00e1 getur\u00f0u safna\u00f0 saman uppl\u00fdsingum til a\u00f0 tryggja a\u00f0 uppl\u00fdsingum fr\u00e1 endanotendum s\u00e9 r\u00e9tt safna\u00f0 saman og r\u00e9tt skipt ni\u00f0ur. Tilf\u00f6ng geta veri\u00f0 \u00e1\u00fereifanleg (fart\u00f6lva, skrifbor\u00f0st\u00f6lva, fars\u00edmi) e\u00f0a hugb\u00fana\u00f0ur e\u00f0a hugb\u00fana\u00f0arleyfi (innskr\u00e1ning a CRM forrit). Nota m\u00e1 tilfangahluta \u00ed sni\u00f0m\u00e1ti \u00fej\u00f3nustuskr\u00e1ar til a\u00f0 safna \u00feessum uppl\u00fdsingum saman. \u00de\u00fa getur skipulagt uppl\u00fdsingas\u00f6fnun me\u00f0 \u00fev\u00ed a\u00f0 spyrja nokkurra spurninga. H\u00e6gt er a\u00f0 setja fj\u00f6lda spurninga undir eitt tilfang og sni\u00f0m\u00e1ti\u00f0 getur haft nokkur tilf\u00f6ng.</p>",
