"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.chngRoles.content" : "<p>\u00de\u00fa getur b\u00fai\u00f0 til hlutverk sem t\u00e6knimenn eiga \u00ed breytingum sem byggjast \u00e1 \u00fe\u00e1ttt\u00f6ku \u00feeirra \u00ed breytingunni. T\u00e6knima\u00f0ur getur be\u00f0i\u00f0 um breytingu, stj\u00f3rna\u00f0 henni, sam\u00feykkt hana, fari\u00f0 yfir hana, sett hana \u00ed framkv\u00e6md o.s.frv. Hlutverk a\u00f0ila \u00ed breytingunni hj\u00e1lpa \u00fe\u00e9r a\u00f0 skilgreina leyfisstig t\u00e6knimanna var\u00f0andi \u00e1kve\u00f0na breytingu.</p>",
"zia.approvalwiz.needclarificationinfo" : "Nota\u00f0u forriti\u00f0 til a\u00f0 b\u00e6ta vi\u00f0, breyta og ey\u00f0a s\u00e9rsni\u00f0num g\u00f6gnum sem gefa til kynna \u00datsk\u00fdringar er \u00fe\u00f6rf. Eftir a\u00f0 \u00fe\u00fa sendir breytingarnar inn mun Zia nota n\u00fdjustu g\u00f6gnin til a\u00f0 \u00fej\u00e1lfa sig.",
