"question.no.options.info.message" : "Spurningar sem eru b\u00fanar til \u00e1n valkosta ver\u00f0a f\u00e6r\u00f0ar \u00ed \u00f3virka st\u00f6\u00f0u",
"form.decimal.msg" : "Leyfilegur h\u00e1marksfj\u00f6ldi er {0} heilt\u00f6lur og {1} tugat\u00f6lur.",
"cmdb.migration.intro.para5" : "N\u00fa \u00feegar flutningur s\u00e9r um a\u00f0 b\u00faa til eigindir yfirtegundar v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is sem vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreiti eignar (undir vi\u00f0eigandi v\u00f6rutegund) skaltu fara \u00ed gegnum eftirfarandi skref \u00fat fr\u00e1 umhverfi \u00fe\u00ednu til a\u00f0 flytja undirtegund v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is og/e\u00f0a eigindir \u00feess sem vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreiti eignar.",
"sdp.admin.requestcloserule.text" : "\u00c1skildir reitir til a\u00f0 loka bei\u00f0num sem eru ekki me\u00f0 l\u00edft\u00edma uppsettan.",
"standard.hours" : "Sta\u00f0alt\u00edmar",
"cmdb.migration.intro.para4" : "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa uppf\u00e6rir \u00ed \u00fatg\u00e1fu {0} munum vi\u00f0 a\u00f0sto\u00f0a \u00feig vi\u00f0 a\u00f0 flytja eigindir v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is yfir \u00ed vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreiti eignar. \u00deessi flutningur b\u00fdr sj\u00e1lfkrafa til eigindir v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is \u00ed yfirtegund v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is sem vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreiti undir v\u00f6rutegund eignar. \u00dear af lei\u00f0andi ver\u00f0ur samstillingarregla v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is b\u00fain sj\u00e1lfkrafa til, sem tengir v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0ategundina vi\u00f0 v\u00f6rutegund og varpar eigindum v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0is vi\u00f0 eignareiti.",
"cmdb.migration.intro.para3" : "\u00dev\u00ed ver\u00f0a ekki allar eignir sem b\u00fanar eru til \u00ed eignaeiningunni flokka\u00f0ar sem v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0i undir CMDB og \u00f6fugt. A\u00f0 auki ver\u00f0a vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreitir eignar n\u00fa a\u00f0eins birtir undir eignum og eigindir sem eru skilgreindar undir CMDB birtast a\u00f0eins undir v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0um.",
"cmdb.migration.intro.para2" : "En fr\u00e1 og me\u00f0 \u00fatg\u00e1fu {0} ver\u00f0a ekki allar eignir, notendur og \u00fej\u00f3nustur talin vera v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0i; a\u00f0eins \u00feau sem eru fyrirt\u00e6kinu \u00fe\u00ednu mikilv\u00e6g og \u00feurfa meiri athygli til a\u00f0 geta veitt \u00e1rangursr\u00edka uppl\u00fdsingat\u00e6kni\u00fej\u00f3nustu ver\u00f0a talin vera afbrig\u00f0i.",
"mail.ews.connect.url.error" : "Grunnstillt tengivefsl\u00f3\u00f0 er \u00f3gild. Nota\u00f0u eftirfarandi vefsl\u00f3\u00f0arsni\u00f0:\n\u201ehttps://<your_mail_server_hostname>/EWS/Exchange.asmx\u201c",
"cmdb.migration.intro.para1" : "\u00cd \u00fatg\u00e1fum sem eru eldri en {0} eru allar eignir sem b\u00fanar eru til \u00ed eignaeiningunni taldar vera v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0i (e. Configuration Items, e\u00f0a CI) undir CMDB og \u00f6fugt. \u00deetta \u00e1 vi\u00f0 um allar vi\u00f0b\u00e6tur \u00e1 eign, eins og handvirka f\u00e6rslu, sk\u00f6nnun og CSV-innflutning. Vi\u00f0b\u00f3tarreitir eignar og v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0aeigindir birtast b\u00e6\u00f0i \u00ed eignum og v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0um.",
