"ae.cmdb.inventory.listview.delSelectMsg" : "\u00deegar v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0i/v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0um er eytt mun \u00f6llum fj\u00e1rm\u00e1laferli tengdum \u00fev\u00ed/\u00feeim vera eytt. Ertu viss um a\u00f0 \u00fe\u00fa viljir ey\u00f0a v\u00f6ruafbrig\u00f0unum sem \u00fe\u00fa valdir?",
"sdp.admin.resolutiontemplate.markinactive.helpbody" : "Ef g\u00e1treitur er valinn mun \u00feetta \u00farlausnarsni\u00f0m\u00e1t vera gert \u201e\u00d3virkt\u201c og mun ekki vera s\u00fdnt \u00feegar leyst er \u00far bei\u00f0ni. H\u00e6gt er a\u00f0 gera \u00fea\u00f0 virkt aftur me\u00f0 \u00fev\u00ed a\u00f0 \u00f3gilda val g\u00e1treitarins.",
