"sdp.request.externalaction.executor.scripthelp" : "<strong>D\u00e6mi:</strong> CreateJiraTicket.txt<br> Sj\u00e1lfgefi\u00f0 er a\u00f0 textaskr\u00e1in s\u00e9 sett \u00ed skr\u00e1asafni\u00f0 [Application Home]/integration/custom_scripts/executor_files directory<br> D\u00e6mi um innihald keyrsluskr\u00e1r <strong>py Create_Jira_Ticket.py $COMPLETE_V3_0_JSON_FILE</strong>, Create_Jira_Ticket.py skr\u00e1r \u00e6tti a\u00f0 setja \u00ed skr\u00e1asafni\u00f0 [Application Home]/integration/custom_scripts",
