"approval.anyone.approves.text" : "Sam\u00feykki er veitt ef einhver af sam\u00feykktara\u00f0ilunum hefur sam\u00feykkt; er a\u00f0eins hafna\u00f0 ef allir sam\u00feykktara\u00f0ilar hafa hafna\u00f0.",
