"schedulesettings.redisc.info" : "\u00deessi \u00e1\u00e6tlun leitar a\u00f0 t\u00e6kjum sem n\u00fdlega var b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0 netkerfi\u00f0 e\u00f0a l\u00e9ni\u00f0 og skannar \u00feau me\u00f0 netkerfa- e\u00f0a UEM-fulltr\u00faaskilr\u00edkjum, \u00ed \u00feeirri r\u00f6\u00f0.",
"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.chngWorkflow.content" : "<p>Vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i breytinga gera \u00fe\u00e9r kleift a\u00f0 stj\u00f3rna l\u00edft\u00edma breytinga.  Breytingar og vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i eru breytileg eftir fyrirt\u00e6kjum. V\u00e9lb\u00fana\u00f0ur \u00fej\u00f3ns getur nota\u00f0 anna\u00f0 vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i en MSSQL uppf\u00e6rsla. \u00c1 sama h\u00e1tt \u00fearf a\u00f0 me\u00f0h\u00f6ndla stillingar eldveggs \u00e1 annan h\u00e1tt en breytingar \u00e1 vefs\u00ed\u00f0u. Sta\u00f0la\u00f0ar (fyrirfram sam\u00feykktar), hef\u00f0bundnar og ney\u00f0arbreytingar eiga s\u00edn eigin vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i. \u00de\u00fa getur skilgreint mismunandi stig breytingar og f\u00e6rt inn mismunandi st\u00f6\u00f0ur sem breyting fer \u00ed gegnum \u00e1 hverju stigi. Vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i breytinga sj\u00e1 um a\u00f0 koma breytingu \u00ed gegnum \u00fdmis sitg e\u00f0a st\u00f6\u00f0ur og h\u00e6gt er a\u00f0 senda tilkynningar til vi\u00f0eigandi a\u00f0ila \u00ed t\u00f6lvup\u00f3sti \u00e1 hverju stigi vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0isins.</p>",
