"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.templatesFormCustom.content" : "<p>\u00de\u00fa getur b\u00fai\u00f0 til s\u00e9rsni\u00f0i\u00f0 sni\u00f0m\u00e1t me\u00f0 sj\u00e1lfgefnum og s\u00e9rsni\u00f0num reitum fyrir hverja \u00fej\u00f3nustu sem \u00fe\u00fa b\u00fd\u00f0ur upp \u00e1. H\u00e6gt er a\u00f0 merkja reiti sem skyldureiti og endurskipuleggja \u00fatlit me\u00f0 eiginleikanum draga og sleppa (drag and drop). \u00de\u00fa getur veitt einstaklingsbundna notkun fyrir endanotendur \u00ed sj\u00e1lfsafgrei\u00f0slug\u00e1ttinni me\u00f0 \u00fev\u00ed a\u00f0 bj\u00f3\u00f0a \u00feeim einungis \u00fe\u00e1 \u00fej\u00f3nustu sem \u00feeir hafa r\u00e9tt \u00e1 e\u00f0a sem \u00e1 vi\u00f0 hlutverk \u00feeirra. \u00de\u00fa getur \u00fathluta\u00f0 \u00fej\u00f3nustustigssamningum fyrir hvert sni\u00f0m\u00e1t, sett upp vinnufl\u00e6\u00f0i, skilgreint marg\u00fe\u00e6tt sam\u00feykktarferli og tengt verk hvert vi\u00f0 anna\u00f0.</p>",
